DESCRIPTION >
    Synthetic attribution proof only.

SCHEMA >
    `scenario` String `json:$.scenario`,
    `version` UInt64 `json:$.version`,
    `transaction_id` String `json:$.transaction_id`,
    `profiles` Array(String) `json:$.profiles[:]`,
    `chunk_ids` Array(Array(String)) `json:$.chunk_ids[:]`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY scenario, version
